Built on Hermes Agent by Nous Research (MIT). Not affiliated with or endorsed
by Nous Research.

This image is built from the Talaria Hermes image
(ghcr.io/usa-reddragon/talaria-hermes), which is the upstream Hermes Agent
image with the Talaria patches. "Hermes Agent" names the upstream project
only. The image contains:

- Hermes Agent, https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
  Copyright (c) 2025 Nous Research, MIT License: LICENSE.hermes-agent
  The Talaria patches use the same terms; their own notice is in
  /usr/share/doc/talaria-hermes/.
- talaria-hub (/usr/local/bin/talaria-hub), MIT License:
  https://github.com/USA-RedDragon/talaria/blob/main/LICENSE
- talaria (/usr/local/bin/hermes-device), MIT License:
  https://github.com/USA-RedDragon/talaria/blob/main/LICENSE
- Caddy (/usr/local/bin/caddy), https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy
  Apache License 2.0: LICENSE.apache-2.0
- poppler-utils and the other Debian packages, under their own licenses in
  /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright.
